#. module: devarc_qr_reconcile
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:devarc_qr_reconcile.field_account_journal__devarc_qr_reconcile_mode
msgid ""
"Mark: statement lines carrying a QRR or SCOR reference of exactly one open "
"customer invoice get that invoice linked and proposed, nothing is "
"reconciled. Reconcile exact matches: additionally reconcile the line when "
"its amount equals the invoice residual; partial payments and overpayments "
"are only linked. A reference without exactly one open invoice links no "
"invoice, the line is listed under the filter QR Reference Without Invoice."
msgstr ""

